		{
			dependencies: ["2C6BEB5BBE5A91DC"]
			description: [
				"The &bMV&3 Assembler&r allows you to craft &6Medium Voltage Coils&r, and your &3Laser Engraver&r can make &6Ultra Low Power ICs&r with a &6Sapphire Lens&r."
				""
				"Combine them with some MV parts and you can finally craft an &6MV Energy Hatch&r."
