		{
			description: [
				"&6Sulfur&r will be used in a variety of upcoming chemical reactions."
				""
				"It can be electrolyzed easily from &6Sphalerite&r (which also provides &6Gallium&r), &6Cinnabar&r, and &6Pyrite&r. Alternately, Sulfur can be acquired through &bHNN&r in Normal Mode."
