		{
			dependencies: ["5B0200011DF8E1B6"]
			description: [
				"You'll need &9Chlorine&r at this point. It is an important ingredient in many chemical processes, and you can currently get it from electrolyzing either &6Salt&r or &6Rock Salt&r."
				""
				"&2Later, you can use Fluid Rigs or break down Ghast Tears to obtain Salt Water, and electrolyze it to Chlorine. "
				""
				"&rUsing Fluid Rigs is the best way to obtain mass amounts of Chlorine."
