		{
			dependencies: ["3E42B4AAA6D2A05B"]
			description: [
				"These devices can help you build, swap blocks, destroy massive areas, or even copy-paste regions. You need the blocks you plan to paste in your inventory though; it doesn't make them from nothing."
				""
				"Also important to note is that it can act wonky with Tile Entities, so it is mainly useful with simple blocks (it doesn't paste machine or hatch configuration, for example)."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A very cool feature of this mod is how you can &8shift-right click&r an inventory with any gadget (if you are using a &6Copy-Paste Gadget&r to do this, it must be on &ePaste&r mode) and the gadget will pull items from the inventory, 'connecting' the gadget to the inventory."
				""
				"For example, if you &8shift-right click&r a chest full of &6Cobblestone&r, the gadget will use &6Cobblestone&r from that chest to place blocks."
				""
				"By default, the config GUI is bound to &8G&r."
			]
			icon: "buildinggadgets2:gadget_building"
			id: "5F9C7FB40AD2640B"
			subtitle: "This pack has &bBuilding Gadgets&r."
			tasks: [{
				id: "512BC0AAD462E586"
				item: {
					Count: 1
