		{
			dependencies: ["6169C04DF463502F"]
			description: [
				"The &6Ender Fluid Link&r is a cover that you can place on the sides of machines."
				""
				"When interacted with, it opens a GUI that allows you to specify which channel it will interact with, either pushing or pulling fluids from all other links on the same frequency."
				""
				"Frequencies are distinguished based on an 8 character hexadecimal color code. Optionally, you can give each frequency a description. In the top left of the link's GUI, you can find a button leading to a menu with a list of all available frequencies and their descriptions."
				""
				"There is a limited number of available frequencies, so try to keep the number of fluid links below 16,777,216."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "7C5CE283172CD952"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "All out of spaghetti?"
